flowchart LR
  Client[Web / Mobile] --> GW[API Gateway]
  GW --> S[M3 - Meetings]
  S --> AUTH[M0 Identity claims / authorization]
  S --> DB[(Service-owned PostgreSQL schema)]
  S --> IDEM[(Idempotency records)]
  S --> OUT[(Transactional outbox)]
  OUT --> MQ[(RabbitMQ)]
  MQ --> INBOX[(Consumer inbox / deduplication)]
  S -. cache only .-> R[(Redis)]
  S -. telemetry .-> OBS[Logs / Metrics / Traces]
  S --> HR[HR identity references]
  S --> PT[Projects & Tasks API for action items]
  S --> DOC[Documents API]

